      en: ["Located near the tri-point border of Guinea, Liberia, and Sierra Leone.", "Hosts one of the largest weekly cross-border markets in West Africa.", "The population was recorded at roughly 79,000 in 2014.", "A major production area for coffee, cocoa, and palm oil.", "Suffered extensive damage during rebel attacks in 2000 and 2001.", "The initial epicenter of the 2013-2016 West African Ebola epidemic."]
