      en: ["Founded in the 19th century by the military and religious leader El Hadj Umar Tall.", "Home to a highly venerated, historic thatched-roof mosque.", "Served as the launching point for the Toucouleur Empire.", "Located in the dry savanna region of northern Guinea.", "Population of the urban commune was around 47,000 in 2014.", "An important regional center for cattle herding and groundnut farming."]
